  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8102.05 “Municipality” or “municipal” means “municipality” or “municipal” as defined in RSA 672:10, namely “includes and relates to cities, towns, village districts, and counties in which there are located unincorporated towns or unorganized places.”\n\nSource. #12022, eff 10-26-16",
